---
description: >-
  a backslash and an n written as two characters stay text in participant,
  message, note and loop labels; only <br> breaks the line (#763, D564)
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Al\nice
  participant B
  A->>B: m\nx
  Note over A,B: n\nx
  loop l\nx
    B-->>A: one<br>two
  end
  A->>B: C:\new\path
